{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "62b7d607d73acd849fe718628d9c2808b8670285bc375db1697ea63cb5a402ee", "ja": "（地方公演は終わったけど、『タウラス』のみんなの\n活動はまだ続いている。今日は全員で、PVの撮影だ）", "zh": "（虽然地方公演结束了，但『金牛座』大家的活动还在继续。今天是全员一起拍摄PV。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "9cd7d78298d31ef47618772147566109e3a28d9c1fc6f9ae117a0409dc429b63", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまなのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f4436d89d1fd0435db57da32e91eaaecf7c11b93cc60433d623b7ff0ad11c2d1", "ja": "まつり、早いんだな。\nお疲れさま、調子はどうだ？", "zh": "真早啊，祭。\n辛苦了，状态怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "cfccdd582b8b6a70df5e4746072f77fd6a1a2dbda1b63474991992568dbd5bf4", "ja": "もちろん、バッチリなのです。\n昨日のリハーサルも、いい感じにできたのです。", "zh": "当然，状态棒棒的哦。\n昨天的彩排也进行得很顺利哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "cdb729a3d8b2d000038f5adfb1ba92b2b848c64bb839b867bec836668e5b3942", "ja": "天体公演は終わってしまいましたけど、\n劇場の公演はまだまだ続くのです……。", "zh": "天体公演虽然已经结束了，\n但剧场的公演还会一直继续下去的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "fe3ff7909bd1944c56b003ae8244eea2430cb4e212e72e0a9676c1962a1c4873", "ja": "だから姫は、新たな気持ちでPV撮影に挑むのです！", "zh": "所以小公主要怀着全新的心情，投入PV的拍摄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1006_p", "source_sha256": "33716726712746bb9bb5a3c516c3cd40c78f912305a6b741445c42a06e3dd8d4", "ja": "うん、そうだな。天体公演を観てくれた人達にも、\n新鮮な気持ちでPVを見てもらえるよう、頑張ろう！", "zh": "嗯，你说得对。为了让看过天体公演的人们\n也能带着新鲜的心情来看MV，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "271530dd3701c28d1d964335e57c4cbcbdf138407397c09c6c803414cf0877a1", "ja": "はいなのです！　ファンのみんなに、\n新鮮な気持ちをお届けするのです♪", "zh": "没错哦！要让所有粉丝都能感受到新鲜的心情♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "9c8253f21db238ccb91e68f73bb99ad17688eda34d7cfea4aaea0e7cd1928588", "ja": "ところで{$P$}さん。\nまつりはたしか、記憶喪失だったのですよね？", "zh": "话说回来，{$P$}先生。\n小祭记得自己失忆了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9d9e8c81f6ee74c6830e7839c9388b5901b186a3f37fbd3c431f4755c037bb05", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。", "zh": "啊，是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "694e2610ec991909e8d6f5ad78dbe0754e600f933c2b40e6bf6b18cc4a6b3e6e", "ja": "記憶喪失のまつりは、どんなまつりでしたか？\nマシュマロのこと以外にも、何か言いませんでしたか？", "zh": "失忆的茉莉是什么样的茉莉呢？除了棉花糖以外，她还说过什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6381e385886f6d7179d9fe3224b00651e5f75f12327f7255b8e5498ff3b7d8e3", "ja": "え？　そうだな……\n特に変わった事は言ってないと思うけど。", "zh": "诶？这个嘛……\n我觉得她没说什么特别奇怪的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4fbfaf25693611b935130f255c13203c90d6fb313e06fd1b38bea7be302bedcf", "ja": "あ、でもそういえば美也と未来が、まつりはウミウシも\nそんなに好きじゃないみたいだって言ってたかな。", "zh": "啊，不过说起来，美也和未来好像说过，茉莉似乎也没那么喜欢海牛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "a753a5980d0717a14b2be139ce258c8269dd439173d822f6a52d4089449eae69", "ja": "む～……。やっぱりそれは、ニセモノなのです。\nまつりのフリをした、ニセモノの姫なのです！", "zh": "唔～……。那果然是假冒的。\n是假冒茉莉的假公主！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "42a09fd42f980a61a5ed281558775f8e67f7bde624165686886ff3ebfc762968", "ja": "まつりはきっと、宇宙人に乗っ取られていたのです！\nそうに違いないのです～！", "zh": "茉莉一定是被外星人占领了身体！\n一定是这样没错的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d9a0aef4ac92966014f8f9e0ff935e5e0366d72eb4c13278fa3f8291864da654", "ja": "ええ……？　まぁ確かに、まつりが記憶を失った日に、\nちょうど隕石が落ちてくるって話があったけど……。", "zh": "咦……？不过确实，听说就在茉莉失去记忆的那天，正好有陨石坠落……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "ec0132348a5ed3358485f1bd2b04f1d72379e1ed885e3a50f7a920383df1f19f", "ja": "びんご！なのです！\n{$P$}さん、絶対にそれなのです！", "zh": "答对啦！{$P$}先生，肯定就是那个啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "085a4bd4e9d8922d2a0fced059dd0ef43f46d2d6afe2c8f232dfcd99d810fbc2", "ja": "まつりに、お星さまが当たったのです。\nきっとそれが、隕石だったのですよ！", "zh": "有颗星星砸到小祭身上了哦。\n那一定就是陨石啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1018_p", "source_sha256": "649f9509538ca5c6d4a280816564e160b57199a32017f713081aeb529854d4cb", "ja": "まぁ、そうと考えられなくもないけど……\n美也もそう言ってたしな。", "zh": "嗯，这么想也不是不行……\n美也也这么说过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "741022d87ea0c57eca02ddbdb962202dafeb0d3e28c80aecedfd123f334cec7e", "ja": "間違いないのです！\nだから記憶喪失ではなくて、宇宙人なのです。", "zh": "不会错的！所以不是失忆，而是外星人哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "409cb6fcda9c99e1256f3769d941dfc2f61f1374bdb3e418ed8144aa312766cd", "ja": "なのでそのまつりは、まつりではないのです。\n……ね？　{$P$}さん。ね？", "zh": "所以，那个时候的茉莉，并不是茉莉哦。\n……对吧？{$P$}先生。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0173_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2be9570f9d0f192464e871252ba100efa4febee626719335290e256578112863", "ja": "（記憶喪失の間の事、まつりはどうしても認めたくない\nみたいだな……とにかく元に戻ったし、良しとしよう）", "zh": "（虽然是失去记忆期间发生的事，但真纪似乎无论如何都不愿承认……总之她已经恢复了，就这样吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
